OL,4,BSenegal reinstated as Afcon 2025       
OL,5,Bwinners by court ruling                
OL,6,GSenegal have been reinstated as        
OL,7,Gwinners of the 2025 Africa Cup of      
OL,8,GNations after a ruling by the Court of 
OL,9,GArbitration for Sport.                 
OL,11,FThe court's award overturns a previous 
OL,12,Fdecision which had stripped the West   
OL,13,FAfricans of the title they won on the  
OL,14,Fpitch during a chaotic final against   
OL,15,Fhost nation Morocco in January.        
